<template><view class="page"><image class="bg" :src="route.runBg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="mask"/><view class="content"><view class="tag">计入线路：{{route.name}}</view><view class="hero"><text>{{calorie}}</text><small>千卡 · 卡路里</small></view><view class="metrics"><view><b>{{distance}}</b><text>距离 km</text></view><view><b>6'08''</b><text>配速 /km</text></view><view><b>{{time}}</b><text>时长</text></view></view><view class="segment"><view><b>聊城</b><text>济宁</text></view><view class="bar"><view :style="{width:progress+'%'}"/><i :style="{left:progress+'%'}"/></view><text>距下一站还有 {{(100-progress)*1.1}} km</text></view><text class="hint">预览模式：点击下方按钮模拟跑步数据变化</text><button class="simulate" @tap="simulate">模拟跑一段（+0.5km）</button><view class="controls"><button @tap="running=!running">{{running?'暂停':'继续'}}</button><button class="finish" @tap="finish">结束</button></view></view></view></template>
<script>import {routes} from '../../common/mock.js';export default{data:()=>({route:routes[0],calorie:28,distance:'3.50',time:'00:21:28',progress:36,running:true}),onLoad(q){this.route=routes.find(r=>r.id===q.id)||routes[0]},methods:{simulate(){this.distance=(Number(this.distance)+.5).toFixed(2);this.calorie+=31;this.progress=Math.min(96,this.progress+8)},finish(){uni.showModal({title:'本次运动已完成',content:`模拟消耗 ${this.calorie} 千卡，运动 ${this.distance} 公里`,showCancel:false})}}}</script>
<style scoped>.page{height:100vh;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.bg,.mask{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.mask{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,12,6,.35),rgba(20,12,6,.3) 45%,rgba(20,12,6,.75))}.content{position:relative;height:100%;padding:calc(80rpx + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 40rpx 55rpx;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.tag{color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:2rpx solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);border-radius:99rpx;padding:6rpx 24rpx}.hero{margin-top:50rpx;text-align:center;color:#fff}.hero text,.hero small{display:block}.hero text{font-size:144rpx;font-weight:800;line-height:1}.hero small{font-size:28rpx;margin-top:16rpx;opacity:.8}.metrics{display:flex;width:100%;margin-top:55rpx}.metrics view{flex:1;text-align:center;color:#fff}.metrics b,.metrics text{display:block}.metrics b{font-size:42rpx}.metrics text{font-size:24rpx;opacity:.7;margin-top:10rpx}.segment{width:100%;margin-top:38rpx;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:20rpx;padding:25rpx 30rpx;color:#fff;text-align:center}.segment>view:first-child{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.bar{height:12rpx;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:99rpx;margin:18rpx 10rpx;position:relative}.bar view{height:100%;background:#fff}.bar i{position:absolute;top:50%;width:24rpx;height:24rpx;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);box-shadow:0 0 0 6rpx rgba(255,255,255,.35)}.segment>text{font-size:24rpx}.hint{color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:22rpx;margin-top:20rpx}.simulate{margin-top:24rpx;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff;border:2rpx dashed rgba(255,255,255,.6);border-radius:99rpx;font-size:28rpx}.controls{display:flex;width:100%;gap:30rpx;margin-top:auto}.controls button{flex:1;border-radius:99rpx;line-height:100rpx;font-size:34rpx;font-weight:600}.finish{background:rgba(0,0,0,.35)!important;color:#fff}</style>
